mission "Ashcombe's Last Wager"
    name "Ashcombe's Last Wager"
    description "Defeat the six Company warships at the Governor's Road, then return to Havana to learn whether Ashcombe escaped."
    source "Port Azure"
    destination "Havana"
    lead "Anne Bonny passes you a folded note from Port Azure. “A former Company purser has come ashore there and asked for protection. He says he knows where Ashcombe keeps his last reserve. I will meet you at the harbour and hear him out. No need to run blind into danger; speak with him when you reach the harbour.”"
    reward 1650
    objective kills 6
    battlefield "The Governor's Road" 2900 1850
    enemy "The Governor's Road Guard 1"
    enemy "The Governor's Road Guard 2"
    enemy "The Governor's Road Guard 3"
    enemy "The Governor's Road Guard 4"
    enemy "The Governor's Road Guard 5"
    enemy "The Governor's Road Guard 6"
    speaker offer "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    speaker visit "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    speaker complete "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    to offer
        has "The Bells of Port Royal: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `At Port Azure, the former Company purser gives Bonny the last of Ashcombe’s sailing orders. They reveal that six ships are preparing to seize Havana and hold the governor as a bargaining piece.`
            `The Meridian Star is among them. The Company hopes its flagship will convince the harbour batteries to surrender without firing.`
            `The fleet is larger than any you have faced. The free captains will engage the escorts while you seek an opening against the named ships.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The fleet is larger than any you have faced. The free captains will engage the escorts while you seek an opening against the named ships.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Bonny gives you command of the outer line. “Save the harbour, captain. He will not take Havana today.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted Ashcombe's Last Wager. Defeat the six Company warships at the Governor's Road, then return to Havana to learn whether Ashcombe escaped."
    on visit
        conversation
            `The Company fleet is scattered, and the Meridian Star is badly damaged. Ashcombe abandons ship and escapes into the harbour among the smoke.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Havana has been saved, but the Company captain must answer for what he has done.`
        log "Completed Ashcombe's Last Wager. Received 1650 gold. Havana has been saved, but the Company captain must answer for what he has done."
